            "value": "Alertes de nouveaux modèles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Models Meter connects directly to each selected provider for account data. The public Anthropic model catalog comes from models.dev. There is no Models Meter backend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Models Meter contacte directement chaque fournisseur sélectionné pour les données du compte. Le catalogue public Anthropic provient de models.dev. Models Meter n’a pas de serveur relais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens, session credentials and API keys are encrypted with Android Keystore on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
